1
00:00:00,026 --> 00:00:03,026
Ready, set, go.

2
00:00:07,242 --> 00:00:09,412
- Come on, Sheldon, you got this.
- Indeed.

3
00:00:09,577 --> 00:00:12,037
(Sheldon:)We are prepared for anything
he can throw at us.

4
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:21,006
(Sheldon:)That's new.

5
00:00:21,172 --> 00:00:22,502
(Leonard:)Run, Monte, run.

6
00:00:22,674 --> 00:00:25,304
RAJESH: Run, Monte.
LEONARD: Go. Go, Monte, go.

7
00:00:25,844 --> 00:00:27,974
- Run, Monte.
- Go, go, go.

8
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:34,350
(Sheldon:)Don't hurt us, don't hurt us,
don't hurt us.

9
00:00:40,733 --> 00:00:45,533
(Leonard:)Well, so much for making up
for the emotional wounds of childhood.

10
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,490
(Sheldon:)I did this.

11
00:00:48,658 --> 00:00:51,868
(Sheldon:)Monte was killed
by my hubris and my pride.

12
00:00:52,036 --> 00:00:54,126
(Sheldon:)No matter what anybody says,
this is my fault.

13
00:00:54,289 --> 00:00:56,579
(Raj:)No one's arguing with you, dude.

14
00:00:57,458 --> 00:01:01,018
I got your text. How bad is...? Oi.

